    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652220/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1733980447\" /></div><br><br>All characters in this game are 18 or older.<br><br>&quot;Liz&quot;, a girl who lost everything within seconds...<br>To get her fortune back, she enters the<br>forbidden dungeon full of monsters...<br>But...<br><br>It's finally here! A fast-paced, exhilarating, comedy RPG!!<br><br>[About the Title]<br>The main character Liz is a tomboy, innocent, and most of all, &quot;pure.&quot;<br>A fast-paced turn-based RPG packed with action and laughter.<br><br>Genre: High tension slapstick comedy RPG<br><br>[Style/How to play]<br>-As you get further into the story, the enemy gets stronger, so you'll need to collect materials to <br>upgrade your weapons and armors. You can also teach your character new magic. No difficult puzzles involved. Just beat the Boss and move on to the next Dungeon!!<br>It's quite simple, you won't find yourself stuck in midgame.<br><br>[Playing time]<br>-8 hours + additional challenges",
